abstract: >
  This repository contains the complete dataset and analysis pipeline for
  "AI-Driven Credit Risk Assessment for Bangladesh SMEs: Achieving 90% Accuracy
  with Structured Data Alone". The dataset includes 1,200 SME loan applications
  from Bangladesh with structured features (numeric, categorical) and text
  features (business descriptions, loan narratives). The analysis demonstrates
  that simple logistic regression achieves 0.900 ROC-AUC, exceeding typical
  benchmarks by 12-28%, while text features add negligible value (<1%).
